def rating(r):
 vals=[f"{m[k]['baseScore']} {m[k].get('baseSeverity','')}" for m in r['cvss']['metrics'] for k in m if k.startswith('cvssV') and isinstance(m[k],dict) and 'baseScore' in m[k]]
 return '/'.join(vals) or 'not supplied'
T=['# Member-relevance proposal under broader selection policy','','Completed bounded research, 2026-10-19. The architect owns the authoritative revised selection; this is source evidence and a proposal, not advisory text or per-node exposure evaluation. Original 41 and original exposure findings are preserved.','','**19 proposed additions** comprise 5 exact-build negative assessments, 3 program-authority conditional assessments, and the prior 11 host-mount/module conditional entries now selected for member relevance. Five more cases are review-only and 2 remain deferred. [Exact 26-row proposal](member-relevance-evidence/proposal.json) preserves independent relevance/exposure decisions, primary/fix/introduction evidence, CVSS, previous decisions, scopes and next evidence.','','The union would be 60 proposed IDs if the architect accepts these 19 alongside the unchanged41. No dossier/draft/publication approval is implied. All 26 IDs occur in the existing 317 focused new records; 3,128 new records remain mechanical-only/unresolved. No fresh broad enumeration was performed.','','## What the negative conclusions mean','','`not_affected` below is restricted to the exact archived build or named reference profile. It does not classify all nodes, another release, a calendar interval, overridden profiles, or real host/storage workloads. Current deployed state, historical fleet intervals and mitigation activation remain unknown. Unavailable evidence stays unknown; a fixed current release is not proof that older releases were never affected. The repository evaluator and conservative historical evidence rules remain unchanged.','','The five build negatives use the exact archived 6.12.95 configuration (SHA256 `c10922b492fdf39ed3027b9c8f7ce2846a5d3799d57d417a161595fa81a64969`, Linux `'+BASE+'`). [Configuration excerpts](member-relevance-evidence/config-excerpts.txt),[archive provenance](platform-evidence/frozen-config-provenance.json). MPTCP is absent; PREEMPT_RT substitutions are absent despite PREEMPT_DYNAMIC/PREEMPTION being enabled.','','Other gates use pinned [package A source evidence](platform-baseline.md):[BPF loader](https://github.com/vpsfreecz/linux/blob/'+BASE+'/kernel/bpf/syscall.c#L2687),[token authority](https://github.com/vpsfreecz/linux/blob/'+BASE+'/kernel/bpf/token.c#L16),[reference seccomp](https://github.com/vpsfreecz/lxc/blob/267e7844c122b9be56ca8a1ccc3d2f4d8986c326/config/templates/common.seccomp#L6),[module policy](https://github.com/vpsfreecz/vpsadminos/blob/'+OS+'/os/modules/config/kernel.nix#L159),[CIFS registrations](https://github.com/vpsfreecz/linux/blob/'+BASE+'/fs/smb/client/cifsfs.c#L1111),[mount gate](https://github.com/vpsfreecz/linux/blob/'+BASE+'/fs/super.c#L688). [Input hashes](member-relevance-evidence/source-manifest.json) bind reused evidence.','','## Proposed additions','','| CVE / primary | First fix / stable commit | Member benefit and concrete defect | Source-scoped exposure |','| --- | --- | --- | --- |']
